<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title><description>SONiC NOS（sonic-net/SONiC）の日本語非公式ドキュメント</description><link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link><atom:link href="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <docs>https://github.com/aoki-taquan/sonic-unofficial-docs</docs><language>ja</language> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:46:37 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:46:37 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> </image> <item> <title>変更履歴</title> <category>changelog</category> <category>meta</category> <description>変更履歴 — このページは merged PR のメタデータから meta/scripts/gen_changelog.py で機械生成されています。手で編集しないでください。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/changelog.png" type="image/png" length="19713" /> </item> <item> <title>カバレッジ</title> <description>カバレッジ — このページは docs/**/*.md の frontmatter verification フィールドを集計したものです。meta/scripts/gen_coverage.py で自動生成されます。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/coverage.png" type="image/png" length="23000" /> </item> <item> <title>サイトマップ</title> <category>meta</category> <category>sitemap</category> <description>サイトマップ — docs/**/*.md を mkdocs nav 順で階層列挙したインデックス（全 1098 ページ）。meta/scripts/gen_sitemap.py で自動生成。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/sitemap.png" type="image/png" length="22774" /> </item> <item> <title>スナップショット</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;スナップショット&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;リポジトリ全体の状態を 1 ページに集約した自動生成サマリ。個別の詳細は &lt;code&gt;coverage.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;sitemap.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;discrepancies.md&lt;/code&gt; を参照。&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;!!! note &#34;生成元&#34; `python3 meta/scripts/gen_snapsho...&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/snapshot.png" type="image/png" length="16430" /> </item> <item> <title>SmartSwitch HA HAMgrD 制限事項と実装乖離</title> <description>HAMgrD の制限事項と実装乖離。community master 上で hamgrd バイナリ未取り込み、DASH_HA_DPU_STATE / VDPU_TABLE 未定義、swbus 不在、Switch-Driven mode TBD など、HLD と実装の差分を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-limitations/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-limitations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-limitations.png" type="image/png" length="41475" /> </item> <item> <title>運用者向けガイド</title> <description>運用者向けガイド — 既に SONiC を運用している読者を想定した入口。日々の確認、設定変更、障害調査、CONFIG_DB の意味確認、show techsupport やログ・ヘルスチェックの使い方に加え、症状別の逆引き表をインラインで提供します。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/operator/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/operator/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/operator.png" type="image/png" length="19962" /> </item> <item> <title>FlexCounter リファクタ（CounterContext テンプレート化）</title> <description>FlexCounter リファクタ（CounterContext テンプレート化） — syncd の FlexCounter は port / queue / buffer pool / priority group など 多数の統計・属性タイプ を扱う巨大クラス。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/sonic-flexcounter-refactor/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/sonic-flexcounter-refactor/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/sonic-flexcounter-refactor.png" type="image/png" length="41353" /> </item> <item> <title>gNOI System Reboot / RebootStatus / CancelReboot（reboot method と sanity check）</title> <description>gNOI System Reboot / RebootStatus / CancelReboot（reboot method と sanity check） — gnoi.system.System のうち SONiC が初期サポートする RPC は Reboot / RebootStatus / CancelReb…</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/gnoi-hld-for-system-apis/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/gnoi-hld-for-system-apis/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/gnoi-hld-for-system-apis.png" type="image/png" length="55619" /> </item> <item> <title>VXLAN / VNet 設定と運用（CONFIG_DB / APP_DB / CLI）</title> <description>VXLAN / VNet の設定経路。CONFIG_DB / APP_DB スキーマ、CLI 一覧、VNet ピアリングの設定例、運用時のトラブルシューティング手順を扱う。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/overlay/vxlan-sonic-operations/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/overlay/vxlan-sonic-operations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/overlay/vxlan-sonic-operations.png" type="image/png" length="48543" /> </item> <item> <title>用語集 (Glossary)</title> <description>用語集 (Glossary) — SONiC NOS で頻出する固有用語・略語・コンポーネント名・データベース名・デーモン名を、アルファベット順に整理した日本語用語集です。各エントリは「用語 / 略称 / 日本語訳 / 簡潔な説明 / 関連ページ」の形式で記載しています。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png" type="image/png" length="30026" /> </item> <item> <title>VLAN メンバーを追加してもタグが付かない</title> <description>Runbook: VLAN メンバーを追加してもタグが付かない症状の切り分け。CONFIG_DB / APPL_DB / ASIC_DB および kernel bridge での確認手順と、別 VLAN untagged 多重設定が config vlan member add -u で明示失敗する挙動の説明。sonic-swss vlanmgrd / sonic-utilities config vlan member を引用。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/vlan-tagging/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/vlan-tagging/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/vlan-tagging.png" type="image/png" length="30938" /> </item> <item> <title>HLD と実装の乖離 一覧（discrepancy-index）</title> <description>HLD と実装の乖離 一覧（discrepancy-index） — verification: discrepancy-found が付いた全ページを monitor subtype 別に分類した一覧。meta/scripts/gen_discrepancy_index.py で生成。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/verification/discrepancy-index.png" type="image/png" length="41531" /> </item> <item> <title>sonic-banner YANG</title> <description>sonic-banner YANG — Login, MOTD, and logout banner message YANG module for SONiC OS.</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-banner/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-banner/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-banner.png" type="image/png" length="38293" /> </item> <item> <title>sonic-queue YANG</title> <description>sonic-queue YANG — egress queue ごとの scheduler / wred_profile 紐付け (QUEUE_LIST と VOQ_QUEUE_LIST の switch_type 分岐)</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-queue/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-queue/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-queue.png" type="image/png" length="38452" /> </item> <item> <title>SONiC における FRR upgrade の手順とパッチ管理</title> <description>SONiC における FRR upgrade の手順とパッチ管理 — SONiC は upstream frrouting/frr を branch スナップショット + per-release patch 集 という形で取り込んでいる。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/detailed-steps-to-upgrade-frr-in-sonic/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/detailed-steps-to-upgrade-frr-in-sonic/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/detailed-steps-to-upgrade-frr-in-sonic.png" type="image/png" length="42195" /> </item> <item> <title>Ordered ECMP（nexthop に sequence_id を付け同一フローを同 ToR に固定）</title> <description>Ordered ECMP は nexthop を IP 昇順で並べ SAI に sequence_id 付きで投入することで、全 T1 から同じフローを必ず同じ T0 に landing させ、flow state を持つ appliance ペアでの state miss を防ぐ。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/high-level-design-document/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/high-level-design-document/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/high-level-design-document.png" type="image/png" length="51456" /> </item> <item> <title>VRF / ECMP / RIB-FIB パイプライン</title> <description>VRF / ECMP / RIB-FIB パイプライン — SONiC の L3 転送を「VRF と interface を作る」「route が FRR から APPL_DB に来る」「orchagent が RIF / next hop / route object を ASIC に作る」「ECMP の種類を選ぶ」の順で読み直す章入口。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/index.png" type="image/png" length="40127" /> </item> <item> <title>アーキテクチャ</title> <description>アーキテクチャ — ACL の中心は AclOrch です。設定は CONFIG_DB から入り、APPL_DB を経由して AclOrch が SAI ACL table、entry、counter に変換します。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/07-acl-copp-mirror/architecture/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/07-acl-copp-mirror/architecture/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/07-acl-copp-mirror/architecture.png" type="image/png" length="22468" /> </item> <item> <title>gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig / YANG</title> <description>gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig / YANG — この章は、SONiC の「モデル駆動管理」を、リクエストが入る入口から ConfigDB に到達するまでの順で読み直すための入口である。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/index.png" type="image/png" length="45249" /> </item> <item> <title>概要</title> <description>概要 — SONiC のモデル駆動管理は、CLI、gNMI、REST という 3 つの入口が、Translib / Transformer という共通の中間層を通って ConfigDB へ到達するように作られている。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/concept/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:44:39 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/concept/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/concept.png" type="image/png" length="23412" /> </item> </channel> </rss>